<!--
  21:9 patches for inFAMOUS Second Son 01.07 (CUSA00004), base PS4 mode (keep PS4 Pro / Neo mode OFF).
  Enable ONE "Ultrawide" entry at a time, and do not combine with the official "Render resolution" patches.
  The "Disable ..." entries can be combined with any Ultrawide entry.

  Ultrawide lines (addresses are for the unwrapped 01.07 eboot):
    startup   0x1eff47/0x1eff4e  render W/H  [res+0xc]/[res+0x10]
              0x1eff55/0x1eff5b  output W/H  [res+0x0]/[res+0x4]  -> display buffers (sceVideoOutSetBufferAttribute)
    mode set  0x1f0d3d/0x1f0d4c  base-mode render W/H (esi/edi)
              0x1f0d38/0x1f0d47  output W/H (ebx/ecx) + NOP of the two cmoves that copy render size into output size
                                 (only in the split render/output entries, same technique as the official resolution patch)
    globals   0x1f03ff/0x1f03f8  display W/H 0x1d0ccc0/0x1d0ccc4 (HUD scale, safe area)
-->
